{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38564","headline":"望嵩山 · 吴融","name":"望嵩山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十六峰危似冠，晴楼百尺独登看。\n高凌鸟外青冥窄，翠落人间白昼寒。\n不觉衡阳遮雁过，如何锺阜鬬龙盘。\n始知万岁声长在，只待东巡动玉鸾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}